        "raw": "<p>Trevor with all the cheeky Writers' Room musical stings. :3</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Okay, so the whole story about Archie made me feel like I'd been following comics for thirty years and finally got a major emotional payoff. ;_; The crying month indeed. I have to imagine Fanatic's books were actually pretty good to follow. Don't know why I would have thought otherwise (religions of the world aside).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It's really bittersweet, as they said, seeing C&amp;A interact on this bimonthly schedule. :B Always great to hear them back again, though. Absence makes the heart grow fonder and all that?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Definitely going to be spending the rest of the day looking back through Letters Page posts and seeing how I reacted to each episode so I can compile a top ten list. &lt;.&lt;</p>",
