        "username": "Sea-Envy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-10-07T06:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I did not get into it but i also considered that the Thorathian cultural focus on duality could be drawn to the Heaven/Hell and God/Devil duality.<br>\nA rebellious youth fighting against dualistic tradition could be interested in the theological, mathematical puzzle of the holy Trinity. (For some reason i thought of the story about St. Patrick and the clover)</p>\n<p>I also had hoped they would come up with some story like they did with the atheist theology professor</p>\n<p>and for reference the other ideas i had had were a nun from the convent and an atheist, but my first instinct was not the cool professor but a charity worker type doing good “just because” not based on divine mandate. (there is a whole thing about a priest explaining why God made atheists)</p>\n<p>Edit Liar Liar if you want to write a story based on my plot seed you have my blessings</p>",
